#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Appointments App</b>:</strong> Allow students to book lessons "
"online 24/7, syncing automatically with\n"
"            instructor availability to prevent double-booking.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບການນັດໝາຍ (Appointments)</b>:</strong> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ນັກຮຽນຈອງຊົ່ວໂມງຮຽນອອນລ"
"າຍໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດ 24/7 ພ້ອມທັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນອັດຕະໂນມັດກັບ\n"
"            ເວລາຫວ່າງຂອງຄູຝຶກ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການຈອງຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ.<br/>"

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Fleet App</b>:</strong> Track and maintain your vehicles, "
"monitoring fuel logs, service contracts,\n"
"            and odometer readings to keep your cars road-ready.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບຍານພາຫະນະ (Fleet)</b>:</strong> ຕິດຕາມ ແລະ ບຳລຸງຮັກສາພາຫະນະຂອງທ່າ"
"ນ, ກວດສອບປະຫວັດນ້ຳມັນ, ສັນຍາການບໍລິການ,\n"
"            ແລະ ໄລຍະທາງເລກກິໂລແມັດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລົດພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ສະເໝີ.<br/>"

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Planning App</b>:</strong> Manage instructors' schedules "
"efficiently, assigning shifts and ensuring\n"
"            the right teacher is available for the right class.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບການວາງແຜນ (Planning)</b>:</strong> ຈັດການຕາຕະລາງເວລາຂອງຄູຝຶກຢ່າງມີປະ"
"ສິດທິພາບ, ຈັດແບ່ງກະການສອນ ແລະ ຮັບປະກັນວ່າ\n"
"            ມີຄູຝຶກທີ່ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບແຕ່ລະຫ້ອງຮຽນ.<br/>"

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Sales App</b>:</strong> Sell lessons, exams, and course packages "
"directly to students, managing\n"
"            invoices and payments in one place.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບການຂາຍ (Sales)</b>:</strong> ຂາຍຊົ່ວໂມງຮຽນ, ການສອບເສັງ, ແລະ ແພັກເກດ"
"ຫຼັກສູດໃຫ້ນັກຮຽນໂດຍກົງ, ຈັດການ\n"
"            ໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ ແລະ ການຊຳລະເງິນໄດ້ຢູ່ຈຸດດຽວ.<br/>"

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Sign App</b>:</strong> Handle legal waivers and student "
"agreements digitally, ensuring all necessary\n"
"            documentation is signed and stored securely.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບເຊັນເອກະສານ (Sign)</b>:</strong> ຈັດການໃບຍິນຍອມ ແລະ ຂໍ້ຕົກລົງນັກຮຽນແບບດິ"
"ຈິຕອນ, ຮັບປະກັນວ່າເອກະສານທີ່ຈຳເປັນທັງໝົດ\n"
"            ໄດ້ຮັບການລົງລາຍເຊັນ ແລະ ຈັດເກັບຢ່າງປອດໄພ.<br/>"

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong><b>Website App</b>:</strong> Boost your school's visibility and "
"manage your site, creating a\n"
"            professional portal for new students to register and learn about "
"your services.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"<strong><b>ແອັບເວັບໄຊ (Website)</b>:</strong> ເພີ່ມການເຂົ້າເຖິງໂຮງຮຽນ ແລະ ຈັດການເວັບໄຊ"
"ຂອງທ່ານ, ສ້າງ\n"
"            ປະຕູລະບົບແບບມືອາຊີບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ນັກຮຽນໃໝ່ລົງທະບຽນ ແລະ ຮຽນຮູ້ກ່ຽວກັບການບໍລິການຂອງທ່າ"
"ນ.<br/>"

