#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Note that the Projection Room resource is used by all theory lessons and if "
"you open this resource from the Configuration / Resources menu, it is "
"shareable, meaning multiple bookings can book a slot. This is obviously not "
"the case\n"
"              for vehicles.<br/>\n"
"              On the other hand, practical lessons rely on instructors "
"assuming each instructor has a vehicle available to provide a lesson."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ຊັບພະຍາກອນຫ້ອງສາຍພາບແມ່ນຖືກນຳໃຊ້ສຳລັບທຸກບົດຮຽນພາກທິດສະດີ ແລະ ຖ້າທ່ານເປີດເບິ່ງຊັບ"
"ພະຍາກອນນີ້ຈາກເມນູ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ / ຊັບພະຍາກອນ, ມັນຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນໄດ້ ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າສາມາດຮັບການຈອງ"
"ຫຼາຍລາຍການໃນຊ່ວງເວລາດຽວກັນ. ເຊິ່ງແນ່ນອນວ່າຈະແຕກຕ່າງ\n"
"              ຈາກຍານພາຫະນະ.<br/>\n"
"              ໃນທາງກົງກັນຂ້າມ, ບົດຮຽນພາກປະຕິບັດແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບຄູຝຶກ ໂດຍສົມມຸດວ່າຄູຝຶກແຕ່ລະຄົນມີພາຫະນະ"
"ພ້ອມສຳລັບການສອນຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Note that the quotation templates with packs of hours will as well charge "
"the loyalty cards."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ແມ່ແບບໃບສະເໜີລາຄາທີ່ມີແພັກເກດຊົ່ວໂມງ ຈະເພີ່ມຈຳນວນເຂົ້າໃນບັດສະສົມຄະແນນນຳເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid "Odoo offers you infinite possibilities, such as:"
msgstr "Odoo ມອບຄວາມເປັນໄປໄດ້ຢ່າງບໍ່ຈຳກັດໃຫ້ທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Of course, this is just an overview of the features included in this "
"package. Feel free to add new apps, delete/modify demo data, and test "
"everything around!"
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນວ່າ ນີ້ເປັນພຽງພາບລວມຂອງຟັງຊັນຕ່າງໆທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກດນີ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເພີ່ມແອັບໃໝ່, ລຶບ/ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່"
"າງ, ແລະ ທົດລອງໃຊ້ງານທຸກຢ່າງໄດ້ຕາມສະດວກ!"

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid "On its calendar view, create a new booking adjusting dates and contact."
msgstr "ໃນມຸມມອງປະຕິທິນ, ໃຫ້ສ້າງການຈອງໃໝ່ໂດຍການເລືອກວັນທີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່."

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once confirmed, the appointment is booked!"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, ການນັດໝາຍກໍຈະຖືກຈອງສຳເລັດທັນທີ!"

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once your customer has signed the waiver, a message captures the signed "
"document in the contact chatter!"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານເຊັນໃບຍິນຍອມແລ້ວ, ລະບົບຈະບັນທຶກເອກະສານທີ່ເຊັນແລ້ວນັ້ນລົງໃນກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕິດຕໍ່ທັນທີ!"

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Appointments App</strong> to see all appointments made "
"available to your customers."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການນັດໝາຍ (Appointments)</strong> ເພື່ອເບິ່ງການນັດໝາຍທັງໝົດທີ່ເປີດໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຈ"
"ອງໄດ້."

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Contact App </strong>and create a new customer record "
"filling in especially the email address."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບຜູ້ຕິດຕໍ່ (Contacts) </strong>ແລ້ວສ້າງຂໍ້ມູນລູກຄ້າໃໝ່ ໂດຍສະເພາະແມ່ນການຕື່ມທີ່ຢູ່ອີເ"
"ມວ."

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Appointments App, and go to the Leaves from the Configuration menu."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບການນັດໝາຍ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູ ການລາພັກ (Leaves) ພາຍໃຕ້ເມນູ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Configuration)."

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Fleet App to see all your vehicles."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບຍານພາຫະນະ (Fleet) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງພາຫະນະທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the door for more custom workflows and actions with the power of "
"<strong>Studio App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດໂອກາດສຳລັບຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ດ້ວຍພະລັງຂອງ <strong>ແອັບ "
"Studio</strong>."

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the lesson to be booked from the Appointment App."
msgstr "ເປີດບົດຮຽນທີ່ຕ້ອງການຈອງຈາກແອັບການນັດໝາຍ."

#. module: driving_school
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:driving_school.homepage
msgid ""
"Our driving school specializes in comprehensive driver education, behind-the-"
"wheel training, and road safety courses. We tailor our programs to fit the "
"unique needs of each student, helping them become confident and responsible "
"drivers."
msgstr ""
"ໂຮງຮຽນສອນຂັບລົດຂອງພວກເຮົາມີຄວາມຊ່ຽວຊານດ້ານການສຶກສາການຂັບຂີ່ແບບຄົບວົງຈອນ, ການຝຶກອົບຮົມການຂັບຂີ່ຕົ"
"ວຈິງ, ແລະ ຫຼັກສູດຄວາມປອດໄພເທິງທ້ອງຖະໜົນ. ພວກເຮົາປັບປຸງໂຄງການຮຽນໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງນັ"
"ກຮຽນແຕ່ລະຄົນ, ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາກາຍເປັນນັກຂັບຂີ່ທີ່ມີຄວາມໝັ້ນໃຈ ແລະ ມີຄວາມຮັບຜິດຊອບ."

